  '## What''s Changed

### Changed

- **"Receive shared content" moved into Special Settings** — the standalone editor card is now a sub-item at the end of **Special Settings → Basic Toggles**, matching where other subtitle-bearing options live; all its controls (master switch, image/text filters, delivery mode, prompt-before-use) are unchanged (#986, closes #980)

### Fixed

- **Agent live thinking block invisible while streaming** — the streaming "thinking" card stayed fully transparent (showing as a blank gap that only appeared once thinking finished) because its Compose state was keyed on the changing content; the block now renders live as tokens arrive, and manually collapsing it is no longer undone by the next delta (#983, closes #981)

